ind":"announcement","title":"Ink & Lore demo now supports Traditional Chinese","summary":"Thank you for checking out Ink & Lore. During Steam Next Fest, many players from Taiwan and Hong Kong visited the store page, so we added Traditional Chinese (繁體中文) to the demo as its fifth language. All in-game text is available in Traditional Chinese, including cards, items, dialogue and comics. The game uses a Traditional Chinese typeface, so characters are drawn in their Traditional forms. Select it from Settings → Language on the title screen. Japanese, English, Simplified Chinese and Korea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T11:23:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041719","verified_at":"2026-10-25T15:40:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4819010-1844751498233344","game_id":"steam-4819010","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Enemy Quirks, More Techniques, Engravings, Special Pages, Difficult","summary":"Thank you for playing the Ink & Lore demo. Acting on your feedback (\"it gets repetitive once techniques run out\", \"the enemies all behave the same\"), we have rebuilt combat, items, equipment and the map. The enemies have personalities now 13 ordinary enemies, 7 elites and the boss each have a quirk. When two or more Block Guardians gather, they brace together, then all strike the same ally on the next turn. The Scribble Puppy fixes on one of you, and the Blurred Hound hides behind its friends. B","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T07:05:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498233344","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4819010-1844115010496645","game_id":"steam-4819010","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Improved Usability and Balance","summary":"Thank you for playing the Ink & Lore demo! Based on your feedback, we've updated the demo. Here are the main changes. Title Screen On your first launch, the game now starts at the title screen, so you can adjust settings before you begin. Added a \"Quit Game\" button. Audio The BGM was too loud, so the default volumes are now Master Volume 50%, BGM Volume 50%, and SFX Volume 70%. UI Battle When you select a card, it's now clearer how to play it or cancel. Updated the illustrations on Technique car","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T05:30:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010496645","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4819010-1843481262695000","game_id":"steam-4819010","kind":"announcement","title":"The free demo for Ink & Lore is out now","summary":"The free demo for Ink & Lore is out now. Grab it from \"Download Demo\" on this page. A 99-floor picture-book roguelike fought with consumable cards that vanish the moment you play them — and the demo lets you read the first book all the way to its last page. What's in the demo Descend the first book, The First Page, down to its boss on floor 10 (about 1–2 hours per run) Then dive into the second book, Bleeding Watercolor, as far as floor 16 Three companions: the Pencil Swordsman, the Fluorescent ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T11:49:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262695000","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4819010-1840310314341988","game_id":"steam-4819010","kind":"announcement","title":"Ink & Lore is joining Steam Next Fest","summary":"Ink & Lore will take part in Steam Next Fest, running October 19–26, 2026. A free demo will be available during the festival. You'll be able to descend the first book of a 99-floor picture-book dungeon, fighting with consumable cards that vanish once they're used. This world is a picture book that someone stopped drawing — and the deeper you go, the more the artwork comes apart. Dates October 19, 10:00 AM – October 26, 10:00 AM (Pacific Time) We'll announce the demo here the moment it goes live.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T13:50:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314341988","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4819010":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:26:40Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:26:39Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4819010":"2026-10-26T04:26:40Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4819010":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:26:39Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:26:39Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5173300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:26:40Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:26:40Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4819010","app_id":4819010,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:59Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"de92c0bdc713e82d54813510cce87fe6ae75f46031a48842dd4be0f240d3d6c8","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"한 번 쓰면 사라지는 카드로 헤쳐 나가는 99층 로그라이크.\r\n\r\n두 문구 수호자를 이끌고 “누군가 그리다 만 그림책”의 세계로. 한정된 한 수를 언제 낼 것인가.\r\n\r\n그리고 세계의 끝에서 기다리는 것은, 그—","publishers":[{"name":"Shintaro Higashi"}],"developers":[{"name":"Shinta